    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/d31ee2f6fb49459295f1fc335e2351f6","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/d31ee2f6fb49459295f1fc335e2351f6","content":"\u003cdiv class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“These projects are, as I mentioned, very close to my heart. I get to experience and be a part of the development that’s happening in my home town and in areas I grew up around. It’s very special.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith this mission in mind, we are thrilled to announce the latest addition to our laboratory equipment lineup:  the Mastersizer 3000E from Malvern Panalytical. We are the only commercial facility with this capacity.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/d2jl4a0v/polokwane-2.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe City Centre, Polokwane\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/ut3disxs/b.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/1pzhccdb/p4.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eWhat is it like to build the area you\u0027ve always called home?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePotego clarifies what this new development means, both for the area and for himself.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Working on projects close to home has been a blessing and exciting.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNothing beats the feeling of being involved in projects that are close to your heart. Seeing the development \u003cbr\u003eof your own kasi (hometown) is great, but being a part of the team that builds it is special!!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Nothing compares to the feeling of seeing people excited because of a completed development where \u003cbr\u003ethey’ll be shopping, or using the roads or seeing stormwater drains in action… and being there to say \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eNkuna Kraal Filling station\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"td-a-rec td-a-rec-id-content_inlineleft  td_uid_12_633d70de2eeea_rand td_block_template_1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"td-visible-desktop\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"beacon_1c824f1e1b\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 0px; top: 0px; visibility: hidden;\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px;\" src=\"https://ads-za.privatelabel.co.za/www/delivery/lg.php?bannerid=1428\u0026amp;campaignid=218\u0026amp;zoneid=32\u0026amp;loc=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.miningmx.com%2Fnews%2Fbase-metals%2F49235-vedanta-approves-r7bn-project-to-double-up-zinc-from-gamsberg-facilities-in-northern-cape%2F\u0026amp;referer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2F\u0026amp;cb=1c824f1e1b\" alt=\"\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Giyani completes my trip around all of Polokwane. \u003cbr\u003e”We really are seeing the entire province.”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe are geotechnical testing, compaction tests \u003cbr\u003eand DCP’s to enable building platforms, services, storm water pipes and more.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis new Sasol filling station represents new \u003cbr\u003ebuilding and developemnt next to a mall that we \u003cbr\u003ealso assisted with building.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/d2jl4a0v/polokwane-2.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eInterested in our work?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eReach out to us.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>Roadlab is an accomplished supporter of over 400 construction companies and 60 consulting firms. Our particle size analysis capabilities enable us to support their aggregate, soils and quality control needs.</p>",
